{"unit_id":"zydg__dsh-cost#card-zh","repo":"zydg/dsh-cost","commit":"08077e4318316230a355dfbe58608e13876dd104","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的用量与费用统计插件。它通过监听模型流和会话事件记录每次调用，并在每轮对话后显示 token 用量、缓存命中率、按调用时间估算的峰谷费用及账户余额。宿主端提供价格和模型清单管理、记录清空与 CSV/JSON 导出；设置页支持中英文、币种和自定义模型价格。适合需要在对话中查看 DeepSeek 用量与费用的用户；余额查询和模型清单同步需要配置 DeepSeek API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:753-800","lib/client.js:531-605"]}
{"unit_id":"zydg__dsh-cost#card-en","repo":"zydg/dsh-cost","commit":"08077e4318316230a355dfbe58608e13876dd104","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cost tracks usage in DeepSeek Harness and adds a summary after each turn. It shows token counts, cache rate, estimated peak/off-peak cost and balance. Users can edit rates and peak hours, switch language or currency, and export CSV or JSON. Balance lookup and model sync need a DeepSeek API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:753-800","lib/client.js:531-605"]}
